    {
      "type": "intro",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "hero"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-eyebrow"
          },
          "html": "🇬🇧 🇫🇷 🇪🇸 🇧🇷 · Caresse vs Melba · Audio in 4 languages"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "Caresse vs Melba:<br>listen first, <em>decide later.</em>"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "Melba offers a catalog of pre-recorded audio experiences in French and English, validated by couple therapists. The app requires an account and a detailed onboarding where you fill in your intimate preferences before accessing any content. Caresse takes a different path: pre-generated audio demos you can play right now — no sign-up, no account, no email — so you hear the sound quality, the voice and the atmosphere before any decision. Then a bespoke ritual that calls you by name."
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-group"
          },
          "html": "\n            <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" data-store-auto data-cta-position=\"hero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download the app free</a>\n        "
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-badge"
          },
          "html": "Free demos in the app, no sign-up. Paid personalized sessions, no subscription."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "tldr"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "In one sentence"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "The honest summary."
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "tldr-card"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "<strong>Melba</strong> is a library of guided audio experiences in French and English, pre-recorded and presented as validated by therapists. The app requires an account and an upfront onboarding where you share your intimate preferences before accessing the catalog. <strong>Caresse</strong> is different on two fronts: (1) you listen to real audio demos before paying, without a Caresse account, in English, French or Spanish — so you know exactly what you're getting; (2) every paid session is generated on demand from your profile (names, genders, practices, intensity, setting), and you can use the entire app anonymously. You never replay the same thing."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "verdict",
        "id": "verdict"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "The verdict at a glance"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Caresse vs Melba — 8 criteria that matter."
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "verdict-table-wrap"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "table",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "verdict-table"
              },
              "html": "\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Criterion</th>\n                        <th>Caresse</th>\n                        <th>Melba</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Free audio demos, no account</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\"><span class=\"yes\">Yes</span> — demos playable right now</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\"><span class=\"no\">No</span> — account required from the start</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Account required</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\"><span class=\"no\">No Caresse account</span>; Apple or Google account for purchases</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Account required to use the app</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Content type</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Generated scenario, unique every session</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Catalog of pre-recorded experiences</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Your names in the audio</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\"><span class=\"yes\">Yes</span> — the voice calls you by name</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\"><span class=\"no\">No</span> — generic narration</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Scenario personalization</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Genders, practices, accessories, intensity, dirty-talk level, setting, atmosphere</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Pick an experience from the catalog</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Duration</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Varies with generation; exact length is not a setting</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Fixed per experience (≈15–30 min)</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Renewal</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Essentially infinite combinatorial space</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Monthly catalog updates</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Pricing model</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Pay per session, no subscription</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Subscription</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Audio languages</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">French, English, Spanish and Portuguese (PT interface on Android; iOS update awaiting approval)</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">FR, EN</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class=\"crit\">Solo mode + couple mode</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\"><span class=\"yes\">Yes</span> — both modes native</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Couple-focused</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-group",
            "style": "margin-top:32px"
          },
          "blocks": [
