    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "columns"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "The details"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Two approaches, two philosophies."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "Melba chose curation. Caresse chose generation. The promise isn't the same."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "columns-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "col-card highlight"
              },
              "html": "\n                <p class=\"col-sub\">Caresse</p>\n                <h3>Listen first. Decide later.</h3>\n                <p>Before any purchase, you get access to pre-generated audio demos in English, French and Spanish. No sign-up, no account, no email: you hear right away the sound quality, the voice, the atmosphere and the intensity levels. The demos don't speak your name or use your profile, but they faithfully reflect what you're about to experience.</p>\n                <p>When you start a bespoke session, Caresse builds a scenario from your profile: who you are, what you go by, what you want tonight, the intensity, the atmosphere. The voice names you. The scenario doesn't look like any other, because it was only ever written for this session. Anonymous mode needs no Caresse account. Purchases go through your Apple or Google account.</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Audio demos playable without an account (EN · FR · ES)</li>\n                    <li>Anonymous mode, no Caresse account required</li>\n                    <li>Names spoken aloud in the narration</li>\n                    <li>Duration varies with the generated session</li>\n                    <li>Essentially infinite combinations: genders, practices, accessories, intensity, setting, atmosphere</li>\n                    <li>Native couple and solo modes</li>\n                    <li>No subscription: you pay per session</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "col-card muted"
              },
              "html": "\n                <p class=\"col-sub\">Melba</p>\n                <h3>A French-language library curated by therapists.</h3>\n                <p>Melba advertises dozens of pre-recorded audio experiences, designed with couple therapists, and a catalog that's updated regularly. The promise is that of a therapeutic companion: discovery programs, expert articles, interactive challenges. Audio is played as-is for every user.</p>\n                <p>A good fit if you're looking for a reassuring frame, professional validation, and don't mind replaying. Less of a fit if you want to listen without signing up first, if you want the voice to call you by name, or if you want a language other than French.</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Catalog of pre-recorded experiences</li>\n                    <li>Content validated by couple therapists</li>\n                    <li>Discovery programs and editorial articles</li>\n                    <li>Available in French and English</li>\n                    <li>Subscription model, account required</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "pricing"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Pricing"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Pay per session vs subscription."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "Caresse doesn't charge you for the months you don't use the app. Melba offers a 7-day free trial, then $19.99/month or $119.99/year."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "pricing-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "price-card highlight"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Caresse</h3>\n                <p class=\"price-big\">Per session</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">Free download and audio demos. Personalized sessions use credits, with no subscription or monthly renewal.</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:16px;font-size:0.85rem;\">Euro amounts are indicative. Prices may vary by country and store; check the amount shown in the app before purchasing.</p>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;text-align:left;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);padding-top:14px;\">\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>1 experience</span>\n                        <strong>€1.99</strong>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>3 experiences</span>\n                        <strong>€5.49</strong>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.92rem;\">\n                        <span>5 experiences</span>\n                        <strong>€7.99</strong>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;\">Once generated, each experience is yours forever — available any time on your account and in the app.</p>\n                <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);\">\n                    <span>Unlimited Exploration (one-time, lifetime)</span>\n                    <strong>€9.99</strong>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"price-note\" style=\"margin-top:6px;font-size:0.78rem;opacity:0.8;\">Unlocks advanced personalization options + 1 free credit.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "price-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Melba</h3>\n                <p class=\"price-big\">Subscription</p>\n                <p class=\"price-note\">7-day free trial, then $19.99/month or $119.99/year for catalog access.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "pricing-footnote"
          },
          "html": "Melba pricing recorded 17 August 2026 on the US App Store listing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "choose"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "How to choose"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Honestly, who should pick what?"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "No spin. Here's who each app is best for."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "choose-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-card us"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose Caresse if you want…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>to listen to real audio demos before paying, no account required</li>\n                    <li>to use anonymous mode without creating a Caresse account</li>\n                    <li>the voice to call you and your partner by your actual names</li>\n                    <li>an experience that doesn't look like any other, every single time</li>\n                    <li>to personalize the intensity, practices and atmosphere</li>\n                    <li>to pay only for what you listen to, with no idle subscription</li>\n                    <li>a solo mode as polished as the couple mode</li>\n                    <li>Generated audio in EN, FR, ES and PT (PT interface on Android; iOS update awaiting approval)</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-card them"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose Melba if you want…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>a French-language curated library you browse like a catalog</li>\n                    <li>the reassurance of content presented as validated by therapists</li>\n                    <li>editorial programs and couple-focused articles</li>\n                    <li>a classic subscription model, no surprises</li>\n                    <li>to listen to pre-recorded experiences without configuring every time</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub",
            "style": "margin-top:24px;"
          },
          "html": "Leaning toward an English-language library instead? See our comparison with <a href=\"/en/vs-dipsea/\">Dipsea</a>. Curious about a different AI approach? Compare with <a href=\"/en/vs-inthemoment/\">InTheMoment</a>."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Caresse vs Melba — your questions."
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can I listen to Caresse before paying, without creating an account?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. Caresse offers pre-generated audio demos in English, French and Spanish, playable immediately — no sign-up, no email, no account. You hear the sound quality, the voice, the atmosphere and the intensity levels before any decision. Demos don't use your name or profile, but they faithfully reflect the experience."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse require an account like most competitors?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No. Anonymous mode lets you use the app without creating a Caresse account. Purchases go through the App Store or Google Play and require an Apple or Google account on the store you use. That's a structural difference from almost every competitor, where signing up is a prerequisite for everything."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "What's the main difference between Caresse and Melba?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Melba offers a catalog of pre-recorded audio experiences in French and English, designed with therapists. The app requires an account and an upfront onboarding covering your intimate preferences. Caresse generates a unique scenario every time: your names spoken aloud, intensity and atmosphere configured per session. Anonymous mode is available without a Caresse account; purchases use your Apple or Google account."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse run on a subscription or pay-per-session?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse is pay-per-session — no mandatory monthly subscription. You pay when you want a new experience, you don't pay for months you don't use it. Before any purchase, free audio demos let you decide."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is Caresse content as polished as Melba's?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. Every Caresse session runs through a multi-phase pipeline (setup, immersion, first touches, exploration, intensity crescendo, polishing) where every prompt is written and refined by the Caresse editorial team. The voice is then synthesized with premium TTS engines. The result is coherent, rhythmically paced, and never generic. The free audio demos let you judge for yourself before paying."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "How many different scenarios can Caresse generate?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "The combinatorial space is essentially infinite. Each intimate profile combines participants' genders, names, practices, accessories, intensity, dirty-talk level, setting and atmosphere. Where Melba offers a fixed catalog (behind an account and onboarding), Caresse generates a new, unique experience every time, with no friction."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
